        },
        {
          "name": "RDG Builder Recorder",
          "type": "UE::Landscape::FRDGBuilderRecorder&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "LANDSCAPE_EDIT_LAYERS_BATCHED_MERGE_EXPERIMENTAL void",
      "docs": "Perform a clear of the scratch texture\n@param RDGBuilderRecorder  when the recorder is in \"recording\" mode, the clear's render command enqueuing will be delayed to the render thread, after a FRDGBuilder has been created\nbut the scratch render target's current state will still be mutated to reflect the state change on the game thread. In \"immediate\" mode, a render command will be enqueued immediately"
    },
